	(descr "Adafruit MAX31865 RTD amplifier breakout, PT100 version (product 3328): 430 ohm reference resistor, 3.3 V regulator and level shifting on the module. SPI. 2/3/4-wire mode is set by solder jumpers on the module. One 1x8 header plus two 2-pin 3.5 mm terminal blocks (pads 9-12). Pad positions from Adafruit's published Eagle board (github.com/adafruit). Board outline on F.Fab.")
